From 30ba3a9313a5783a44ea555251d5aa292f9de0d0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ruscher <rruscher@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 23:57:53 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] po/pt_BR: Fix the kill confirmation message
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The message is appended to the window title ("<title> will be forcibly
closed."), but the Brazilian Portuguese translation was a standalone
sentence without the leading space, so the dialog showed e.g.
"big-wm-tabbed-dockA aplicação obrigatoriamente será fechada (kill).".
---
 po/pt_BR.po | 4 ++--
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/po/pt_BR.po b/po/pt_BR.po
index e1de719..d69c1a6 100644
--- a/po/pt_BR.po
+++ b/po/pt_BR.po
@@ -44,9 +44,9 @@ msgid ""
 "Any unsaved changes will be lost.\n"
 "Please confirm."
 msgstr ""
-"A aplicação obrigatoriamente será fechada (kill).\n"
+" será fechado à força.\n"
 "Qualquer mudança não salva será perdida.\n"
-"Confirme por favor."
+"Confirme, por favor."
 
 #: ../src/appicon.c:585 ../src/dock.c:282 ../src/winmenu.c:125
 msgid "Kill Application"
-- 
2.55.0

